# Giving a new empty task a due date with T keeps it a task, so typing its text later does not start with a stray dash.
file <<END
- Plan party
END
see Plan party
keys o <Esc> T
see today
keys <Enter> <Home> <S-End>
type Buy gifts
keys <Esc>
see - Buy gifts
quit
saved <<END
- Plan party
- Buy gifts @due({today})
END
